==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|gebuwede|gebūwede|lang=gmh}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|gibuidi|gibūidi|lang=goh}}. Literally meaning ''das Gebaute'' "that has been built".

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ɡəˈbɔɪ̯də]|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-at-Gebäude.ogg|Audio (Austria)}}

===Noun===
